  "notes": [
    "D1 oracle is the official Västtrafik Spårvagns- stombuss- och båttrafik map dated 2026-06-15 plus the Expressbussar och pendeltåg city map on vasttrafik.se. Stations arrays are hand-transcribed from those passenger maps. Not generated from GTFS.",
    "City stays planned. Modes v1: tram 1–12 plus the three city-map pendeltåg (Kungsbacka / Alingsås / Ale). No stombuss, båt, express X-bus, or regional Västtågen beyond those three. No metro.",
    "Timezone Europe/Stockholm HAS DST (CET/CEST). Do not copy Brisbane no-DST.",
    "132 unique tram names + 25 unique train names = 157 unique catalog names.",
    "LOCKED tram hub is Brunnsparken (10 of 12 trams). Lines 8 and 12 miss it — they live at Korsvägen. Do not lock Centralstationen (renamed Drottningtorget 15 Jun 2026). Västtågen hub is Göteborg Central.",
    "Passenger product is line + terminus using the map legend far end (1 + Tynnered, 12 + Lindholmen, Västtågen + Kungsbacka). Never “to City”. First-halt strings stay on the stations arrays (Opaltorget, Axel Dahlströms Torg, Väderilsgatan, Varmfrontsgatan, Aprilgatan, Komettorget, Frölunda Torg, Mölndals Innerstad, Virginsgatan, Doktor Sydows Gata, Älvängen resecentrum).",
    "Line 12 is the new Mölndal–Lindholmen. Line 2 is Högsbotorp–Biskopsgården, not Mölndal. Line 10 is Guldheden–Lindholmen.",
    "doNotGroup: Drottningtorget tram vs Göteborg Central vs Nils Ericsonsplatsen vs Nils Ericson Terminalen; Liseberg Station tram 5 vs Liseberg Station (tåg) vs Liseberg Södra; Gamlestads Torg tram vs Gamlestaden Station.",
    "Swedish characters must be preserved (Göteborg, Mölndal, Frölunda, Kålltorp, Älvängen, Högsbotorp). Stockholm / Malmö / city=sweden are not this city.",
    "Trafiklab GTFS Regional vt: static with TRAFIKLAB_API_KEY; no TripUpdates for Västtrafik. Adapter uses realtime-board.js and falls back to schedule-only. Stay planned. Do not flip live."
  ],
